                                "sense_id": "bb003a79-4108-3e8a-8ba8-8f3fe1b8caa9",
                                "text": "ACP Nik Ezanee closed the investigation by classifying it as no further action (NFA) after hearing about the woman's plight."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0f5e1159-a738-43a0-b2d8-341555d45b65",
                                "sense_id": "bb003a79-4108-3e8a-8ba8-8f3fe1b8caa9",
                                "text": "Police have completed investigations into a Physical Education (PE) teacher who allegedly made a rape joke in front of his students at school, and have classified it as No Further Action (NFA)."
